nard16.txt Section 1 ---","speaker":""}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-b0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d4\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"现在是秋天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f9\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是秋高马肥、硕果累累，适合读书运动的，太阳很快就下山的季节。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-122\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-174\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-122"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那样的景色接踵而来，在这充满变化的季节中，我过着忙碌的日子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-172\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f6\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-172"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我也想吃些好吃的东西，也有些想读的书。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1ac\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-23f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ac"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"嘛，关于艺术的话，因为那是工作所以全年都在做，不过最近有点忙得过头了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-21a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2dd\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-21a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"——过了挺长时间，渐入深秋了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-24c\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-334\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-24c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"对我来说像是过了很长时间似的，但是到头来季节还没有改变也说明了不是那么长时间吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2b0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-3c2\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2b0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"只是……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2cc\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-3df\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2cc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就算季节如何改变，我也不会忘记在晴空之下遇到的少女吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-316\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-452\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-316"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……不，我绝不会忘记千里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-344\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-48d\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-344"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那是毫不动摇的，已经深深地植入我的心底的女孩。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-386\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-503\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-386"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我的记忆力也不错，也是个能够夸口的固执家伙。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-3c6\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-567\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3c6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……不过，这里所说的“不会忘记”，也包含着自己决定了的几个规则。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-41a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-5e7\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-41a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我既没有被过去所困扰，也没有被束缚，我在下定决心后持续着信念……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-46e\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-66b\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-46e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那是我自己担负的规则的大前提。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-4a0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-6ae\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4a0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-4bc\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-6cd\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4bc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我遵守着它，同时专心于那时对千里说过的很大的工作。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-513\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-750\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-513"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……嘛，终于能变得能用过去式述说了呢。」","speaker":"和昭"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-551\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-7a9\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-551"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……我仰望天空。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-575\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-7de\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-575"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那里广延着秋天开始的时候，和千里邂逅的日子同样的蓝天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-5d0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-84c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5d0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……不过就算做了很多次，对委托人用敬语对话，做还真是不习惯呢。」","speaker":"和昭"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-626\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-8af\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-626"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"今天我罕见地系好领带，头发也适当地整理过。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-664\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-90c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-664"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……那是大概在两小时之前的事吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-698\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-943\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-698"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我就像刚才所说过的，对委托人做了这次的对话。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-6d8\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-9ba\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6d8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"对委托人用敬语或者叮咛语我还真是不在行。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-714\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a13\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-714"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而且因为这次我无论如何都想让它成功，让提议被采取，所以那种想法特别的强。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-781\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a8f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-781"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……没问题吧。」","speaker":"和昭"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-7a7\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-ab8\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7a7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我回想起在介绍大部分结束之后，和委托人交流的对话。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-833\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-b67\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-833"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……哎呀，哪个方案都非常出色。」","speaker":"委托人"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-87a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-bb7\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-87a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「非常感谢您，那样的表扬让我的设计有价值。」","speaker":"和昭"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-8ba\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-c25\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8ba"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"介绍的地方是那医院的医疗室。这次工作的委托人是院长以及现役医师。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-90e\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-ca1\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-90e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"嘛，对于我来说，比起在豪华的会议室里面对着高攀满座的集团首脑们说话，我更喜欢平平凡凡的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-98b\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d3e\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-98b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「我觉得，这两个方案是我的得意之作。」","speaker":"和昭"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-9d4\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-dbb\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9d4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，就是浦山先生说的那样。」","speaker":"委托人"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a06\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-df2\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a06"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"委托人很满足似的点着头。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a32\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nard16\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-e31\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nard16","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a32"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"t